---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '@/components/sections/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '@/data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy" description="How Daybytes uses local storage and third-party services on this website." overlayHeader>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Cookie Policy" intro="The browser storage and third-party services used by this website." breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookie Policy', href: '/cookie-policy' }]} />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[760px] px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p>This page describes the browser storage used by Daybytes and the third-party services connected to website features.</p>
      <h2>Storage used by Daybytes</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Theme preference:</strong> the site uses the localStorage key <code>theme</code> to remember your light or dark theme choice. This value is not used for advertising or analytics.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>Cloudflare Turnstile loads from <code>challenges.cloudflare.com</code> on form pages to protect forms from automated abuse. Calendly loads from <code>calendly.com</code> only when you choose to open the booking service. Brevo delivers form-related emails from the server and does not run in your browser. The deployed pages attempt to request the Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon from <code>static.cloudflareinsights.com</code>, but the site's Content Security Policy blocks that request, so the beacon does not load. No first-party cookies were observed during the production check. The only first-party browser storage key found in the site code is <code>theme</code> in localStorage, used to remember your light or dark theme choice. Third-party services may use their own browser storage when you choose to use them.</p>
      <h2>How to control cookies</h2>
      <p>You can clear cookies and local storage, or restrict browser storage, through your browser settings. Clearing local storage will reset your saved theme preference. Blocking third-party storage may affect Turnstile verification or Calendly booking.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>{site.legalName}<br /><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a><br /><a href={site.phone.href}>{site.phone.display}</a></p>
      <p class="mt-10 border-t border-line pt-4 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: 24 October 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
